# C++

Follow [LSB Development Guide — C++](https://github.com/LandSandBoat/server/wiki/Development-Guide). C++20, WebKit + Allman, 4 spaces, LF, UTF-8 BOM on `*.{cpp,h}`. Format with `python tools/run_clang_format.py` (clang-format-20). Do not hand-reflow. `ColumnLimit` is 0.

- `UpperCamelCase` namespaced functions/classes. `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE` enums. `lowerCamelCase` everything else.
- Prefer STL. Be `const`. Be careful with `auto`. Exceptions only when data is at risk or the case must never happen.
- Pointers left-aligned (`CBigType*`). Braces on every `if`/`else`. `static_cast`, not C-style. `dynamic_cast` for downcasts.
- Bind new Lua APIs next to existing helpers in `src/map/lua/`. Prefer types in `src/common/`.
- Wrap lambdas in `// clang-format off` / `on`. Do not change `ext/`, `.clang-format`, or `.clang-tidy` unless asked.

```cpp
// Correct
if (auto PChar = dynamic_cast<CCharEntity*>(baseEntity))
{
    PChar->DoSomething();
}

// Wrong
if (x == 5) { foo(); }
uint32 param = (uint32)input;
```
